writingPrompt.text:
Which factor has contributed more to Coco Gauff's success: her confidence in high-pressure moments or her ability to keep improving over time? Write a multi-paragraph response in which you explain your opinion, using specific evidence found in the passage. Manage your time carefully so that you can:
review the passage;
plan your response;
write your response; and
revise and edit your response. Be sure to:
introduce a clear central idea;
develop your opinion with relevant reasons and details;
use evidence from the passage; and
organize your ideas clearly.
